<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs mostly steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs mostly steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were mostly steady. Trading was moderate. Top $58.25 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    220-260 lbs   57.75-58.25, mostly 58.00</p>
<p>		  260-270 lbs   57.25-57.75</p>
<p>    US 2-3    270-280 lbs   56.25-57.25</p>
<p>Sows - 300-400 lbs $0.50 higher; 400-650 lbs weak to $1.00 lower. Top $53.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    300-500 lbs    48.50, few to 49.50</p>
<p>		  500-650 lbs    50.00-52.00</p>
</text>
